---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /press-kit/
active: press
bodyClass: on-paper
title: Press kit
description: "Biographies at three lengths, photographs, and the curriculum vitae for Adán Fernández — ready for programs, posters and listings."
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Press kit</p>
    <h1>Everything <em>a program needs.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Copy any of these straight into a concert program, a poster, or a listing. No permission needed.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Name &amp; billing</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <div class="stack" style="max-width:70ch">
      <div class="entry reveal"><span class="yr">Full</span><div>{{ site.name }}</div></div>
      <div class="entry reveal"><span class="yr">Short</span><div>{{ site.shortName }}</div></div>
      <div class="entry reveal"><span class="yr">Billing</span><div>Dr. Adán Alejándro Fernández, organist</div></div>
      <div class="entry reveal"><span class="yr">Roles</span><div>{{ site.roles }}</div></div>
      <div class="entry reveal"><span class="yr">Say it</span><div>{{ presskit.pronunciation }}</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-row reveal" style="margin-top:2rem">
      <a class="btn btn-brass" href="{{ presskit.onesheet }}" download>Download the one-sheet (PDF)</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="{{ site.cv }}" download>Curriculum vitae (PDF)</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Biography, one line</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <p class="lede reveal" style="margin-bottom:3rem">{{ bio.oneLine }}</p>

    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Biography, short</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <div class="prose reveal" style="margin-bottom:3rem"><p>{{ bio.short }}</p></div>

    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Biography, full</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <div class="prose reveal">
      {%- for p in bio.long %}<p>{{ p }}</p>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">At a glance</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <div class="stack" style="max-width:80ch">
    {%- for g in presskit.glance %}
      <div class="entry reveal"><span class="yr">{{ g.k }}</span><div>{{ g.v }}</div></div>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Programs</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <p class="lede reveal" style="margin-bottom:2rem">Six programs he has given and can bring. Every program is tailored to the instrument and the occasion; these are starting points.</p>
    <div class="cards">
    {%- for p in presskit.programs %}
      <div class="card reveal"><h3>{{ p.title }}</h3><p>{{ p.desc }}</p></div>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="rule-head"><span class="lbl">Masterclass &amp; lecture topics</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <ul class="pills">
      {%- for x in presskit.topics %}<li>{{ x }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="rule-head"><span class="lbl">Has performed at and with</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <p>{{ presskit.venues }}</p>
      <div class="rule-head" style="margin-top:2.4rem"><span class="lbl">Media</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <ul class="plain">
      {%- for m in presskit.media %}<li>{{ m }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <div class="rule-head" style="margin-top:2.4rem"><span class="lbl">Press</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <ul class="plain">
      {%- for m in presskit.press %}<li><a href="{{ m.link }}" rel="noopener" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--brass-deep)">{{ m.title }}</a><span class="tl-sub"><em>{{ m.where }}</em>, {{ m.year }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tint">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="rule-head"><span class="lbl">Honors &amp; fellowships</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      {% set items = presskit.honors %}{% set key = "year" %}{% include "timeline.njk" %}
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="rule-head"><span class="lbl">Service</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <ul class="plain">
      {%- for s in presskit.service %}<li>{{ s }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <div class="rule-head" style="margin-top:2.4rem"><span class="lbl">Technical &amp; hospitality</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <p>{{ presskit.technical }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Photographs</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <p class="lede reveal" style="margin-bottom:2rem">{{ site.photoCredit }} Please carry the credit wherever they appear.</p>
    <div class="photo-grid">
    {%- for p in photos.items %}
      <figure class="photo reveal">
        <a href="{{ p.file }}" download title="Download, {{ p.w }} by {{ p.h }}"><img src="{{ p.web }}" alt="{{ p.alt }}" width="{{ p.ww }}" height="{{ p.wh }}" loading="lazy"><span class="dl-hint">Download &middot; {{ p.w }} &times; {{ p.h }}</span></a>
        <figcaption>{{ p.alt }}</figcaption>
      </figure>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Documents &amp; links</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <ul class="linklist reveal">
      <li><a href="{{ presskit.onesheet }}" download>{% set icon = "sheet" %}{% include "icons.njk" %}<span class="lk-t">One-sheet</span><span class="lk-d">Name, billing, short biography, positions, honors and contacts on one page</span><span class="lk-k">PDF</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ site.cv }}" download>{% set icon = "doc" %}{% include "icons.njk" %}<span class="lk-t">Curriculum vitae</span><span class="lk-d">Education, positions, performance history, publications and compositions</span><span class="lk-k">PDF</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/assets/img/press/portrait-purple.jpg" download>{% set icon = "image" %}{% include "icons.njk" %}<span class="lk-t">Headshot</span><span class="lk-d">The portrait most programs use, 2400 by 2805, credit Seven Eight Artists</span><span class="lk-k">JPG</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/assets/img/mark.svg" download>{% set icon = "mark" %}{% include "icons.njk" %}<span class="lk-t">Mark</span><span class="lk-d">His organ-pipes mark for posters and programs, brass on dark or ink on light</span><span class="lk-k">SVG</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ site.youtube }}" rel="noopener">{% set icon = "youtube" %}{% include "icons.njk" %}<span class="lk-t">Recordings</span><span class="lk-d">Organ, harpsichord, conducting and lectures on his channel</span><span class="lk-k">YouTube</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ site.management.url }}" rel="noopener">{% set icon = "people" %}{% include "icons.njk" %}<span class="lk-t">Artist management</span><span class="lk-d">{{ site.management.name }}. Bookings through {{ site.management.contact }}, {{ site.management.email }}</span><span class="lk-k">Web</span></a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
